# BELLA HEALTHCARE OS — CURSOR RULES & AI FIREWALL

# READ CONSTITUTION BEFORE ANY HEALTHCARE CODING
# Path: docs/architecture/HEALTHCARE_VERTICAL_CODING_CONSTITUTION.md

1. KERNEL H1-H12 IS FROZEN. NEVER CREATE H13 OR NEW KERNEL ENGINES.
2. PRODUCT LOGIC LIVES ONLY IN src/products/ OR src/platform/healthcare/verticals/.
3. PRODUCT CONSUMES KERNEL ONLY VIA PUBLIC CONTRACTS. NO DIRECT QUERY ON hc_* KERNEL TABLES.
4. MIGRATIONS MUST BE ADDITIVE ONLY. NO ALTER/DROP ON KERNEL TABLES.
5. NO DUPLICATE KERNEL ENTITIES (Patient, Doctor, Encounter).
6. TRANSACTION FIRST EVENT PUBLISHING: DB COMMIT -> DOMAIN EVENT.
7. TENANT ISOLATION IS MANDATORY (GATE 0 / P0).
8. NO 'any' TYPES ALLOWED.
9. OUTPUT ARCHITECTURE_GATE_RESULT.MD BEFORE WRITING PRODUCT CODE.
10. RUN 'npm run healthcare:verify' BEFORE SUBMITTING.
